                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "8312ec29-e656-3ea1-af6d-0339b28ed5da",
                        "entry_id": "d99499b7-6f97-3ca7-bcba-c7711dac36ec",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Seppuku bezeichnet eine extrem ritualisierte Art der männlichen Selbsttötung, die etwa ab der Mitte des 12. Jahrhunderts in Japan vor allem innerhalb der Kaste der Samurai verbreitet war."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d23bfec-f7d4-46fc-a881-01932297b66a",
                                "sense_id": "8312ec29-e656-3ea1-af6d-0339b28ed5da",
                                "text": "Sein Herr befahl ihm, Seppuku zu begehen."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1c096bba-ed78-4822-adee-1e3232c07ee2",
                        "source_entry_id": "d99499b7-6f97-3ca7-bcba-c7711dac36ec",
                        "source_sense_id": "8312ec29-e656-3ea1-af6d-0339b28ed5da",
                        "target_lang_word": "seppuku",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "seppuku",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32ba59d1-fd97-3814-97f5-15d2ab9de802",
                                        "entry_id": "170742b3-3093-37ba-b775-ed8ea24fe9f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A form of ritual suicide by disembowelment using a blade, practiced by Japanese samurai, especially to rid oneself of shame, as a means of protest, or, formerly, as a method of capital punishment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "013feb22-487b-4257-93c0-6557d97aebd5",
                                                "sense_id": "32ba59d1-fd97-3814-97f5-15d2ab9de802",
                                                "text": "“I feel like the only solution is pretty clear,” he said during one online news program in late 2021. “In the end, isn’t it mass suicide and mass ‘seppuku’ of the elderly?” […] At a panel hosted by Globis, a Japanese graduate business school, Dr. Narita told the audience that “if this can become a Japanese society where people like you all commit seppuku one after another, it wouldn’t be just a social security policy but it would be the best ‘Cool Japan’ policy.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "96eb16e1-6892-49a9-b2f0-1eed16e8b42b",
                        "source_entry_id": "d99499b7-6f97-3ca7-bcba-c7711dac36ec",
                        "source_sense_id": "8312ec29-e656-3ea1-af6d-0339b28ed5da",
                        "target_lang_word": "seppuku",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "seppuku",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "81b2ea61-8d2f-3c0d-80f6-010eaee9c514",
                                        "entry_id": "ebb7a635-1f70-337b-b4fa-7824297c49cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Hara-kiri. Suicide rituel japonais consistant à s’ouvrir l’abdomen avec un tantō (le sabre japonais le plus court)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "52305f47-5944-4adf-9a12-aa7b3959062a",
                                                "sense_id": "81b2ea61-8d2f-3c0d-80f6-010eaee9c514",
                                                "text": "Traditionnellement, le seppuku a lieu dans un temple en s’ouvrant l’abdomen."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6171d9a6-c243-4d82-8478-fda557d6bc19",
                                                "sense_id": "81b2ea61-8d2f-3c0d-80f6-010eaee9c514",
                                                "text": "L’hôtel du Mont Rose est donc rose, grande bâtisse trapue au cœur de Zermatt, dont les chambres nobles ont un balcon qui s’ouvre théâtralement sur la haute pyramide tourmentée du Cervin, roide jet de pierre qui semble vouloir éventrer le ciel, mais dévie de sa ligne et se tord en son dernier tiers, comme si, à l’instar du seppuku japonais dans sa phase ultime, il lui fallait aussi le déchirer d’une griffure terminale."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f687c84-f704-496f-a0da-7fbdaf865df5",
                                                "sense_id": "81b2ea61-8d2f-3c0d-80f6-010eaee9c514",
                                                "text": "Il considéra un instant son couteau à viande, comme s’il envisageait d’improviser un seppuku, puis se décida à entamer son entrecôte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0610617-c489-4be3-8775-582fb5a4b5d9",
                                                "sense_id": "81b2ea61-8d2f-3c0d-80f6-010eaee9c514",
                                                "text": "Le “seppuku” spectaculaire de l’artiste plasticien narcissique Pierre Molinier lui avait toujours semblé un monument d’histrionisme théâtral."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "710c68f9-78ba-31ee-9834-dfa637545dc2",
                                        "entry_id": "ebb7a635-1f70-337b-b4fa-7824297c49cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Suicide attenté afin de se repentir de ses péchés."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "b026f82f-a249-438e-bde3-a0c581c47f35",
                        "source_entry_id": "d99499b7-6f97-3ca7-bcba-c7711dac36ec",
                        "source_sense_id": "8312ec29-e656-3ea1-af6d-0339b28ed5da",
